Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,欢迎收看《造物小百科》
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.24,Original,,0,0,0,,On how it's made.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:28.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,光盘究竟是玻璃、金属，还是塑料？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.44,0:00:28.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Compact discs are they glass, metal, or plastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:34.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,其实在某个阶段，它们三者都用到了，下面就来演示
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.60,0:00:34.32,Original,,0,0,0,,The truth is they're all three at one stage or another, and we'll show you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.96,0:00:37.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,奶酪
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.96,0:00:37.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:44.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,马苏里拉是餐桌上的新面孔，却已成为从披萨到帕尼尼的必备食材
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.08,0:00:44.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Mozzarella is a relative newcomer to our diets, and has become an essential ingredient from pizzas to panini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:47.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,但它究竟如何工业化生产？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.80,0:00:47.36,Original,,0,0,0,,But just how is it made on an industrial scale?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:50.10,Translation,,0,0,0,,连裤袜
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.44,0:00:50.10,Original,,0,0,0,,Tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:55.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,这种出了名脆弱的织物，怎能用工厂流水线大规模生产？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.32,0:00:55.60,Original,,0,0,0,,How can something that is notoriously fragile be mass-produced on a factory production line?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,还有荧光灯管
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.08,0:01:01.12,Original,,0,0,0,,And fluorescent tubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:07.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,我们见证了运用汞、荧光粉和喷灯的精密工序
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.84,0:01:07.04,Original,,0,0,0,,We witnessed the precision choreography needed using mercury, phosphorus, and a blowtorch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:08.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,但首先
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.40,0:01:08.96,Original,,0,0,0,,But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:17.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,1981年，日本和荷兰科学家发明了一种颠覆音乐产业的设备
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.52,0:01:17.68,Original,,0,0,0,,in 1981, Japanese and Dutch scientists invented a device that would revolutionise the music industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:19.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,他们制造出了光盘
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.16,0:01:19.68,Original,,0,0,0,,They had produced the compact disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:24.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,如今，这些精巧的装置存储着数以百万计的数据
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.32,0:01:24.32,Original,,0,0,0,,Today, these ingenious devices store millions upon millions of bits of data.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:27.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,无论是办公室、录音室、居家还是档案库
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.88,0:01:27.84,Original,,0,0,0,,In the office, studio, home, or archive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:30.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,光盘都已成为不可或缺之物
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.00,0:01:30.16,Original,,0,0,0,,the CD has become indispensable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:36.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,光盘的生产必须在超净环境中进行
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.64,0:01:36.16,Original,,0,0,0,,The production of compact discs has to be carried out in ultra-clean environments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,任何灰尘颗粒都可能毁掉整个工序
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Any dust particles can wreck the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:43.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,光盘是由原始玻璃母盘翻制而成的
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.36,0:01:43.36,Original,,0,0,0,,Compact discs are copies made from an original glass master disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.52,0:01:46.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在真正的工序才刚开始
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.52,0:01:46.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Now the real work begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:50.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,一块薄玻璃板承载着选定的信息
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.36,0:01:50.08,Original,,0,0,0,,A thin plate of glass has the chosen information,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:54.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,这里就是音乐，用一束明亮的激光刻写上去
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.40,0:01:54.40,Original,,0,0,0,,in this case music, written onto itself using a bright laser beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,信息转写完成后
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.04,Original,,0,0,0,,Once the information has been transferred,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:11.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,要涂上两种化学物质：底漆和感光涂层
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.60,0:02:11.44,Original,,0,0,0,,two chemicals are applied: a primer and a photoresistant coating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:23.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,光盘被小心地从设备中取出
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.48,0:02:23.52,Original,,0,0,0,,The disc is delicately retrieved from the apparatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:28.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后感光涂层要在烤箱里烘干三十分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.52,0:02:28.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the photoresistant coating dries in an oven for thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台显影机有两个喷口
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.72,Original,,0,0,0,,This developer has two spouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:45.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,一个喷洒去离子水，另一个喷出显影液，让刻在玻璃上的数据显现出来
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.44,0:02:45.92,Original,,0,0,0,,One applies deionized water, and the other sprays a solution to develop the data etched on the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:49.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,信息此刻已镌刻在光盘上
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.72,0:02:49.28,Original,,0,0,0,,The information is now engraved on the disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:53.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,光盘被放入这台镀金属设备中
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.20,0:02:53.60,Original,,0,0,0,,The disc is placed in this metal coating equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:59.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,下一步是镀上一层薄薄的镍和钒
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.68,0:02:59.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The next step consists of applying a thin coating of nickel and vanadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:05.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,这一电铸工序得到母盘，后续光盘都将由此制造
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.80,0:03:05.60,Original,,0,0,0,,This electroforming process results in the master from which discs will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:09.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,刻蚀过的玻璃要在化学溶液中浸泡七十分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.32,0:03:09.68,Original,,0,0,0,,The etched glass is immersed in the chemical solution for seventy minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:15.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,取出后，这张盘就成为了压制所有光盘的母模
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.56,0:03:15.12,Original,,0,0,0,,On removal, this disc will be the master die from which all copies are made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:21.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后母模被冲压成所需形状，多余的边角料用于回收
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.40,0:03:21.92,Original,,0,0,0,,The die is then stamped out into the desired shape with any excess material being used for recycling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:53.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,取出母模后，技术员撕下保护母模上数据的薄膜
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.68,0:03:53.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The master is taken out, and a technician peels off the film which protected the data etched onto the die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:58.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,目视检查后，母模被送往压制车间
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.48,0:03:58.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Following a visual inspection, the die is sent to the pressing department,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,在那里，母模被小心地装入模具
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.80,Original,,0,0,0,,where the die is delicately installed into the mould,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:06.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,它将塑造出光盘的形状
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.28,0:04:06.88,Original,,0,0,0,,which will form the compact discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:09.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,光盘由一种名为聚碳酸酯的特殊塑料制成
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.88,0:04:09.68,Original,,0,0,0,,Discs are made from a special plastic called polycarbonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:14.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,模具闭合，液态聚碳酸酯被注入母模
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.56,0:04:14.24,Original,,0,0,0,,The mould is closed and liquid polycarbonate is injected into the die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:18.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,冷却成型后，它就变成一张小巧、坚硬、半透明的光盘
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.88,0:04:18.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Once set, it comes out as a small, hard, translucent disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:21.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,光盘现在可以镀金属层了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.60,0:04:21.68,Original,,0,0,0,,The disc is now ready to be metal coated,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,以便光盘驱动器能够读取
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.84,Original,,0,0,0,,so that it can be read by a CD reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:31.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,机械臂将光盘从模具中取出，放到支架上
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.72,0:04:31.04,Original,,0,0,0,,A robotic arm lifts the disc from the mould and places it on supports.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:41.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,给光盘镀金属是极为短暂而简单的工序
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.52,0:04:41.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Coating the discs with metal is an extremely short and simple process.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:46.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,也就是在塑料光盘上覆盖一层极薄的铝膜
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.84,0:04:46.08,Original,,0,0,0,,It consists of covering the plastic disc with a very thin coating of aluminium.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:04.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,这就是镀铝膜的模具内部
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.88,0:05:04.56,Original,,0,0,0,,This is the inside of the mould where the aluminium coating is applied.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,在几乎全自动的工序中
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.20,Original,,0,0,0,,In an almost totally automated process,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,一家工厂每天可生产十万张光盘
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.88,Original,,0,0,0,,a factory can turn out 100,000 discs a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:26.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,保护光盘表面至关重要
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.52,0:05:26.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Protecting the surface of the disc is essential,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:31.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,于是涂上一层清漆，同时也能让丝网印刷图案牢固附着
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.64,0:05:31.52,Original,,0,0,0,,so a coat of varnish is applied, which also allows the silk screen design to stick well to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:38.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,紫外线灯迅速烘干清漆
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.68,0:05:38.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Ultraviolet lamps quickly dry the varnish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:47.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,而在压制车间，他们进行丝网印刷标签
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.08,0:05:47.52,Original,,0,0,0,,And here in the pressing room, they apply the silk screen label.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:51.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,短短六十秒内就能装饰七十张光盘
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.32,0:05:51.44,Original,,0,0,0,,70 discs can be embellished in just 60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:54.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,丝网印刷完成后
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.84,0:05:54.96,Original,,0,0,0,,And once the silk screen is completed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,成品光盘便进入包装环节
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.20,Original,,0,0,0,,the finished discs leave for packaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:58.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,其实很简单
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.76,0:05:58.48,Original,,0,0,0,,Simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:04.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来，古老的饮食文化有了现代的翻版
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.04,0:06:04.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Next up, age-old cultures have a modern-day reworking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:08.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,它是我们餐桌上的新面孔
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.48,0:06:08.64,Original,,0,0,0,,It's a relative newcomer to our diets,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:12.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,却已成为从披萨到农夫午餐的必备食材
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.88,0:06:12.56,Original,,0,0,0,,and has become an essential ingredient from pizzas to ploughmans.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.88,0:06:13.13,Annotation,,0,0,0,,农夫午餐：英国乡村简餐，含面包奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:16.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,一万年来，乳制品一直是我们果腹的美食
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.20,0:06:16.48,Original,,0,0,0,,For 10,000 years, we've been scoffing dairy products.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:18.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,奶酪形态万千
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.20,0:06:18.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Cheese comes in a myriad of forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:22.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,但它究竟如何工业化生产？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.68,0:06:22.32,Original,,0,0,0,,but just how is it made on an industrial scale?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:30.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,和所有奶酪一样，马苏里拉也从牛奶开始
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.84,0:06:30.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Like all cheeses, mozzarella starts from milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:37.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,出于卫生考虑，运奶罐车卸空后，内外都要清洗
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.52,0:06:37.76,Original,,0,0,0,,For hygiene reasons, the interior and exterior of tankers transporting milk are washed after being emptied.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:43.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,像这样的罐车平均可装载三万升原奶
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.56,0:06:43.28,Original,,0,0,0,,A tanker such as this one can carry an average of 30,000 liters of raw milk,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:47.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,并恒定保持在三到四摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.08,0:06:47.04,Original,,0,0,0,,keeping it at a constant three to four degrees centigrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:53.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,他们把牛奶和副产品乳清
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.48,0:06:53.28,Original,,0,0,0,,They store the milk and whey, a milk byproduct,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:58.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,储存在这些巨大的储罐里，每个容量达二十二万五千升
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.52,0:06:58.64,Original,,0,0,0,,in these immense silos, each with a capacity of 225,000 liters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:13.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台牛奶分离机随后提取多余奶油，按要制作的奶酪种类调整脂肪比例
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.48,0:07:13.52,Original,,0,0,0,,This milk separator then extracts surplus cream to adjust the percentage of fat according to the type of cheese to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:18.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,工序从这台储罐开始，它向巴氏杀菌机供料
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.88,0:07:18.32,Original,,0,0,0,,The process starts with this tank, which feeds the pasteurizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:23.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,巴氏杀菌通过加热杀死部分有害细菌
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.26,0:07:23.04,Original,,0,0,0,,Pasteurization kills certain harmful bacteria through heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:29.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,抽取牛奶样品，以精确测定其乳脂和蛋白质含量
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.00,0:07:29.20,Original,,0,0,0,,Milk samples are drawn off to precisely determine their milk fat and protein content.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,检测在这间移动实验室里进行
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Tests are carried out in this mobile laboratory,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:35.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,实施着严格的质量控制
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.28,0:07:35.04,Original,,0,0,0,,where strict controls are imposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.92,0:07:40.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些试管里装有牛奶样品，将进行微生物分析
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.92,0:07:40.56,Original,,0,0,0,,These test tubes contain milk samples which will undergo microbiological analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:48.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,这是一台容量两万五千升的凝乳机
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.32,0:07:48.24,Original,,0,0,0,,This is a curdler with a 25,000-liter capacity,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:52.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,牛奶和制作马苏里拉的其他关键原料被投入其中
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.24,0:07:52.56,Original,,0,0,0,,into which milk and other essential ingredients for making mozzarella are introduced,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:55.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,比如使牛奶凝固的凝乳酶
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.88,0:07:55.44,Original,,0,0,0,,such as the enzyme rennet that curdles the milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.18,Translation,,0,0,0,,混合物必须持续搅拌并冷却 30 分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.18,Original,,0,0,0,,This mix must be well stirred and cooled for 30 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,搅拌器把乳清搅切成小块
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.72,Original,,0,0,0,,The agitators are used to cut the whey into little lumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:11.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,储罐的温度取决于制作的奶酪种类
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.00,0:08:11.12,Original,,0,0,0,,The temperature of the tanks depends on the type of cheese they're making.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:20.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,蒸煮完成后，乳清被泵送到台面上沥干
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.12,0:08:20.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Once cooking is done, the whey is pumped onto tables to be drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:28.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,固体和液体此时已充分分离
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.20,0:08:28.16,Original,,0,0,0,,The solid and the liquid are now well separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:38.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,流走的液体称为乳清浆
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.76,0:08:38.96,Original,,0,0,0,,The liquid draining away is called lactose serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:47.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,乳清浆将被浓缩，转化为其他乳制品
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.64,0:08:47.04,Original,,0,0,0,,The lactose serum will be concentrated and transformed into other milk-based products.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:55.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,液体几乎全部被抽走
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.72,0:08:55.36,Original,,0,0,0,,The liquid has been almost entirely extracted,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:59.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,奶酪颗粒已经足够干燥，可以进入下一阶段
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.60,0:08:59.68,Original,,0,0,0,,and the cheese particles are now sufficiently dry for the next stage to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:11.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,这把大型自动刀片将奶酪颗粒送入下一道工序——成型机
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.36,0:09:11.44,Original,,0,0,0,,This large automated blade then moves cheese particles towards the next step, which is the molder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:24.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,在成型机中，奶酪先被切碎，再送往蒸煮机
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.04,0:09:24.88,Original,,0,0,0,,In the molder, the cheese is cut up before being carried to the cooker,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:26.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,这是最后一道加工工序
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.68,0:09:26.96,Original,,0,0,0,,the final processing step.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:31.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,混合物终于变成我们所熟知和喜爱的马苏里拉
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.92,0:09:31.60,Original,,0,0,0,,The mixture finally resembles the mozzarella we all know and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:40.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,奶酪最终抵达成型机
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.24,0:09:40.24,Original,,0,0,0,,The cheese finally arrives at the molder,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:41.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,由它赋予奶酪合适的形状
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.48,0:09:41.76,Original,,0,0,0,,which will give it the proper shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.40,0:09:45.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,每个模具的容量为两公斤半
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.40,0:09:45.12,Original,,0,0,0,,Each mold has a two and a half kilo capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.04,0:10:01.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,盐卤，即盐水溶液，既用于冷却，也为奶酪块调味
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.04,0:10:01.92,Original,,0,0,0,,Brine, a salt solution, serves to cool and as well as to salt the cheese blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:07.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,奶酪块从模具中脱出，落入盐卤池
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.48,0:10:07.52,Original,,0,0,0,,The blocks are emptied from their molds and fall into a brine tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:16.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后传送带把它们送往另一个池子，在二摄氏度下浸泡四到十小时
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.48,0:10:16.08,Original,,0,0,0,,They are then carried by a conveyor towards another tank, where they will be immersed for four to ten hours at a temperature of two degrees centigrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:33.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,盐卤喷淋去除池面形成的泡沫
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.76,0:10:33.92,Original,,0,0,0,,Sprays of brine remove the foam which forms at the surface of the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:47.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,起初用卡车运来的三万升牛奶，仅在八到十二小时内就转化为一千四百块奶酪
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.36,0:10:47.44,Original,,0,0,0,,The thirty thousand liters of milk that came in by truck at the beginning has transformed to produce one thousand four hundred blocks of cheese in only eight to twelve hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:52.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,奶酪块最终真空包装，准备发运
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.40,0:10:52.08,Original,,0,0,0,,The cheese blocks are finally vacuum-packed and ready for shipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,《造物小百科》即将播出
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.04,0:10:58.72,Original,,0,0,0,,Coming up in how it's made:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:01.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,连裤袜
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.96,0:11:01.28,Original,,0,0,0,,tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:05.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,这种出了名脆弱的织物，怎能大规模生产？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.00,0:11:05.60,Original,,0,0,0,,How can something that is notoriously fragile be mass-produced?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:13.42,Translation,,0,0,0,,还有荧光灯管，用汞、荧光粉和喷灯完成的精密工序
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.60,0:11:13.42,Original,,0,0,0,,And fluorescent tubes, precision choreography using mercury, phosphorus, and a blowtorch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,广告之后见
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.12,Original,,0,0,0,,See you after the break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,欢迎回到《造物小百科》
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.40,Original,,0,0,0,,Welcome back to how it's made.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.00,0:11:35.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,稍后我们将看到如何用汞、荧光粉和喷灯精密地制造出荧光灯管
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.00,0:11:35.04,Original,,0,0,0,,Later we look at the precision choreography as a fluorescent tube is created using mercury, phosphorus, and a blowtorch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:41.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,但先说回从前，那时的女性只穿丝绸长筒袜
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.84,0:11:41.28,Original,,0,0,0,,But first, there was a time when women wore just silk stockings,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,那是少数人才能负担得起的奢侈品
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.44,Original,,0,0,0,,a luxury that only a few could afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:48.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,后来连裤袜问世，成为更便宜、更方便的替代品
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.16,0:11:48.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Then came the invention of tights, a cheaper, more convenient alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:53.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,但如此娇嫩的东西，如何能在工厂里大规模生产？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.60,0:11:53.76,Original,,0,0,0,,But how can something that is so delicate be mass-produced on a factory scale?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,制作一条尼龙长筒袜只需几分钟
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Making a nylon stocking takes only a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:09.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,但这道工序很复杂，要编织五到八根细如发丝的纱线
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.68,0:12:09.76,Original,,0,0,0,,However, it's a complex operation that involves the knitting of five to eight threads, all as fine as a hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:15.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些纱线通常由尼龙和莱卡制成，结实而富有弹性
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.64,0:12:15.84,Original,,0,0,0,,The threads, usually nylon and lycra, are strong and elastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:18.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,有时还会加入涤纶或棉
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.48,0:12:18.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Sometimes polyester or cotton is added.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,针织机开始运转
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.60,Original,,0,0,0,,The knitting machine goes into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:26.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器九十秒就能织出一条薄丝袜的袜筒
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.72,0:12:26.40,Original,,0,0,0,,This one fashions a tube for sheer stockings in ninety seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:29.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,三分钟织出一条连裤袜的袜筒
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.04,0:12:29.28,Original,,0,0,0,,In three minutes, it makes a tube for tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:33.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,其速度根据所生产的产品调整
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.92,0:12:33.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Its speed is adjusted according to the product being made
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:38.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,在每分钟七百五十到一千两百转之间变化
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.16,0:12:38.00,Original,,0,0,0,,varying between seven hundred and fifty and one thousand two hundred revolutions per minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:44.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,袜筒织好后被吸走，落入袋中等待检验
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.28,0:12:44.00,Original,,0,0,0,,Once the tube is knitted, it's sucked up and lands in a bag where it will be inspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:47.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,五百多台机器分工协作
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.96,0:12:47.12,Original,,0,0,0,,More than five hundred machines share the work,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:50.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,每台只织它专属的一种款式
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.60,0:12:50.00,Original,,0,0,0,,each making a model that is specific to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:58.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在要把两个袜筒接起来
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.16,0:12:58.00,Original,,0,0,0,,The two ends must now be joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:02.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台自动机器把两个袜筒拼合，组成连裤袜
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.96,0:13:02.80,Original,,0,0,0,,This automated machine assembles the two tubes together to form the tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:09.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后剪刀将连裤袜裁开
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.40,0:13:09.48,Original,,0,0,0,,Then scissors cut the tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:21.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,接着这个开口被扩大，以便缝纫时能将两个袜筒缝合在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.12,0:13:21.28,Original,,0,0,0,,This opening is then enlarged to allow for sewing, which will join the two tubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:29.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器人机器只需十秒就能缝好尺码或品牌标签
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.16,0:13:29.84,Original,,0,0,0,,The label with the size or brand name is sewn into place in just ten seconds by this robotic machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:35.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,按这个速度，八小时能缝四千八百个标签
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.64,0:13:35.20,Original,,0,0,0,,At this pace, it sews in four thousand eight hundred labels in eight hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:40.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,安装裆部补片需要做一些准备
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.08,0:13:40.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Installing a gusset requires some preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,剪刀在拼接处剪开一道口子
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Scissors make an incision at the joining point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,接着长筒袜在吸力下被翻面
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the stocking is turned inside out by suction,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:49.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,这样缝线就能从内侧进行
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.20,0:13:49.68,Original,,0,0,0,,so that the stitching can be carried out on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.12,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在要缝制袜脚部分
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.12,Original,,0,0,0,,Now the foot must be sewn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:12.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器人机器把袜脚摆到正确位置
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.76,0:14:12.40,Original,,0,0,0,,This robotic machine places the foot in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:18.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,缝纫机随即缝制，同时高效地裁掉多余材料
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.96,0:14:18.24,Original,,0,0,0,,Then a sewing machine stitches, whilst at the same time efficiently cutting away excess material.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,这道工序仅需十秒
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.76,Original,,0,0,0,,This step requires only ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:26.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后连裤袜在吸力下再次翻回正面
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.36,0:14:26.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the tights are turned right side out again using suction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,安装裆部补片的一切准备就绪
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.60,Original,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready for the installation of the gusset.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:43.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,连裤袜被放进料斗，送往新的工位
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.24,0:14:43.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The tights are placed in a tub and taken to a new work area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:48.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,长筒袜再次被吸起，由操作员放到补片机上
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.32,0:14:48.32,Original,,0,0,0,,The stockings are again suctioned and placed on a gusset machine by the operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:52.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,这种方法能确保补片平整无皱地安装到位
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.04,0:14:52.48,Original,,0,0,0,,This method ensures that the gusset will be installed without a crease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:59.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,安装补片是整道工序的最后一步
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.08,0:14:59.04,Original,,0,0,0,,Putting in the gusset is the final operation in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:05.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,一块预裁好的棉布被滑入预留位置，自动缝好
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.52,0:15:05.28,Original,,0,0,0,,A pre-cut piece of cotton is slid into the space reserved for the gusset and automatically sewn in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,现在只差外观处理了
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Now just the aesthetics need attending to,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:15.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,为它添上一抹色彩
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.84,0:15:15.60,Original,,0,0,0,,and a touch of colour is introduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:22.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,它们被放入洗衣机，其大型滚筒分为四个格室，容量四十五公斤
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.16,0:15:22.48,Original,,0,0,0,,They're placed in a washing machine, which has a large drum with four compartments and a forty-five kilo capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:26.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,连裤袜先经肥皂水洗涤，再浸入染料
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.36,0:15:26.64,Original,,0,0,0,,The tights are washed in soapy water, then immersed in dye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:30.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,温度逐渐攀升到九十三摄氏度
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.20,0:15:30.40,Original,,0,0,0,,The temperature climbs gradually to ninety-three degrees centigrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:34.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,经过五分钟的漂洗，再加入柔顺剂
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.20,0:15:34.56,Original,,0,0,0,,After a five-minute rinsing cycle, a softener is added.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:41.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,烘干后进入检验环节
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.04,0:15:41.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Once dried, they proceed to inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:44.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,连裤袜被套到定型架上
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.16,0:15:44.00,Original,,0,0,0,,The tights are placed onto a frame,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:46.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,将其拉伸以便检验
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.16,0:15:46.88,Original,,0,0,0,,which stretches them and allows them to be inspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.00,0:15:51.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,若一切完好，连裤袜被转到另一套框架上
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.00,0:15:51.04,Original,,0,0,0,,If all is well, the tights are transferred onto another frame,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:52.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,在那里进行熨烫定型
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.36,0:15:52.40,Original,,0,0,0,,where they will be pressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:59.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,连裤袜由光电眼定位并引导
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.84,0:15:59.68,Original,,0,0,0,,The tights are positioned and guided by a magic eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:09.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,最后连裤袜被送入蒸房，只停留两秒半
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.56,0:16:09.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Finally, the tights are carried toward a steam room and remain there for just two and a half seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:14.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后在一百四十度下用七秒半烘干
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.88,0:16:14.32,Original,,0,0,0,,before being dried in seven and a half seconds at one hundred and forty degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:21.30,Translation,,0,0,0,,这里每天生产十八万双
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.68,0:16:21.30,Original,,0,0,0,,One hundred and eighty thousand pairs per day are made here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:25.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,可见脱丝的连裤袜永远不缺替补
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.30,0:16:25.52,Original,,0,0,0,,proof that there will always be a replacement pair for the laddered tights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:37.36,Translation,,0,0,0,,一八四零年，煤气灯作为第一种人工照明被发明出来
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.20,0:16:37.36,Original,,0,0,0,,In eighteen forty, gaslight was the first form of artificial lighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:41.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,直到四十年后，托马斯·爱迪生发明了白炽灯泡
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.92,0:16:41.44,Original,,0,0,0,,Until forty years later, when Thomas Edison invented his light bulb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:47.86,Translation,,0,0,0,,一九零九年，法国人乔治·克劳德研制出荧光灯管
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.32,0:16:47.86,Original,,0,0,0,,In nineteen o nine, the Frenchman George Claude developed the fluorescent tube
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:50.74,Translation,,0,0,0,,其设计沿用至今从未改变
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.86,0:16:50.74,Original,,0,0,0,,and its design has stayed unaltered to this very day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:01.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,荧光灯管的生产极为复杂
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.00,0:17:01.44,Original,,0,0,0,,The production of fluorescent strip lighting is highly complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:06.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,要经历一连串精密的工序：熔化、熔接、弯折、涂敷和焊接
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.92,0:17:06.64,Original,,0,0,0,,A mechanical choreography will ensue to melt, fuse, bend, paint, and solder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:11.72,Translation,,0,0,0,,工序从玻璃管开始，先用温水仔细清洗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.20,0:17:11.72,Original,,0,0,0,,The process starts with glass tubes that have been meticulously cleaned with warm water
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:14.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,去除污垢和杂质
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.72,0:17:14.80,Original,,0,0,0,,to remove dirt and impurities.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:19.84,Translation,,0,0,0,,随后玻璃管还需被塑造成特定形状
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.58,0:17:19.84,Original,,0,0,0,,Then the tubes have to be specifically shaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:21.92,Translation,,0,0,0,,先加热三十秒
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.32,0:17:21.92,Original,,0,0,0,,They're heated for thirty seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,再借助模板快速弯折定型
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.76,Original,,0,0,0,,then quickly curved using a template.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.60,0:17:32.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台自动机器一分钟能弯折十四根玻璃管
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.60,0:17:32.88,Original,,0,0,0,,This automated machine can bend fourteen tubes in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:43.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,弯好的玻璃管进入涂敷室
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.46,0:17:43.44,Original,,0,0,0,,The bent tubes go into the coating chamber,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:47.04,Translation,,0,0,0,,内表面被涂上一层薄薄的荧光粉
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.84,0:17:47.04,Original,,0,0,0,,where a thin coat of phosphorus is applied to the inner surfaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:54.06,Translation,,0,0,0,,正是荧光粉将汞电离产生的紫外线转化为光
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.84,0:17:54.06,Original,,0,0,0,,It's phosphorus which produces light by transforming ultraviolet generated by the ionisation of mercury
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:55.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,不过那是后话了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.06,0:17:55.56,Original,,0,0,0,,but that comes later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:03.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,然后去除玻璃管两端的多余荧光粉，以便后续封口
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.80,0:18:03.16,Original,,0,0,0,,Then, the surplus phosphorus is removed from the ends of the tube so that they can be sealed later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:05.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,接下来是电气部件
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.64,0:18:05.96,Original,,0,0,0,,Next comes the electrical components.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:12.20,Translation,,0,0,0,,阴极部件由一台称为自动装接机的设备制造
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.68,0:18:12.20,Original,,0,0,0,,The cathode device is made in a machine called an auto mount.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,这些导线将承载电流
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.64,0:18:15.56,Original,,0,0,0,,This wiring will carry the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:23.00,Translation,,0,0,0,,载流导线被塑形，然后精确加热
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.56,0:18:23.00,Original,,0,0,0,,The wire carrying the current is shaped, then precisely heated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:25.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,这是为下一步做准备
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.56,0:18:25.08,Original,,0,0,0,,This prepares it for the next step,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:29.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,因为必须防止阴极涂层蔓延到接脚上
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.32,0:18:29.32,Original,,0,0,0,,since it's essential to prevent the cathode coating from spreading to the prongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.02,0:18:37.56,Translation,,0,0,0,,灯丝被插入各自的灯座
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.02,0:18:37.56,Original,,0,0,0,,The filaments are inserted into their mounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:41.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,一种发射性物质在工序中至关重要
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.52,0:18:41.16,Original,,0,0,0,,An emissive substance is crucial in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:45.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,这种液体受热时释放出电子，参与发光过程
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.56,0:18:45.88,Original,,0,0,0,,This liquid, when heated, emits electrons which participate in producing light.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:53.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,导线座从自动装接机送往封口机
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.24,0:18:53.40,Original,,0,0,0,,The wiring mount is transferred from the auto mount to the sealing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:59.70,Translation,,0,0,0,, 这时，灯座与玻璃管终于合为一体
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.00,0:18:59.70,Original,,0,0,0,,At this stage, the mount and the glass tube are finally joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.12,0:19:05.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,封口在极高温度下进行
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.12,0:19:05.28,Original,,0,0,0,,Sealing is done at a very high temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.92,0:19:27.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,还有一道重要工序
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.92,0:19:27.68,Original,,0,0,0,,One important process remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:32.08,Translation,,0,0,0,,在这里，玻璃管内的空气被抽空并充入气体
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.64,0:19:32.08,Original,,0,0,0,,This is where the glass tube is emptied of air and filled with gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:40.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,这台机器还为玻璃管脱碳，并注入那滴对发光至关重要的汞
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.12,0:19:40.48,Original,,0,0,0,,This machine also decarbonizes the tube and introduces the vital drop of mercury, essential for producing light.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.88,Translation,,0,0,0,,汞滴注入灯管之后
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.88,Original,,0,0,0,,Once the drop of mercury is injected into the tube,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:53.60,Translation,,0,0,0,,荧光灯的生产工序便接近完成了
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.28,0:19:53.60,Original,,0,0,0,,the production process for making the fluorescent lamp is now nearing completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:13.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,最后，这台穿线机将导线定位，以便插入灯管盖帽建立电接触
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.64,0:20:13.76,Original,,0,0,0,,Lastly, this threader positions the wires for insertion of the tube cap, which serves to establish electrical contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:16.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,灯管盖帽被放到预定位置
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.56,0:20:16.80,Original,,0,0,0,,The tube cap is placed into position.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:19.76,Translation,,0,0,0,,盖帽不仅要牢固安装
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.44,0:20:19.76,Original,,0,0,0,,The cap must not only be securely attached,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.00,0:20:23.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,还必须密封不漏，杜绝任何泄漏风险
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.00,0:20:23.44,Original,,0,0,0,,but it must also be airtight to eliminate any risk of leaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:35.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,封帽机将盖帽永久密封在灯管上，灯管就完工了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.98,0:20:35.68,Original,,0,0,0,,The capper permanently seals the cap onto the tube, and it's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:50.80,Translation,,0,0,0,,每支灯管都要在一台颇为醒目的测试转轮上检验质量
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.16,0:20:50.80,Original,,0,0,0,,Each lamp is tested on a dramatic-looking testing wheel to verify its quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.96,Translation,,0,0,0,,细致的检验完成后
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.96,Original,,0,0,0,,And once the meticulous inspection is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:06.40,Translation,,0,0,0,,荧光灯便进入包装车间
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.52,0:21:06.40,Original,,0,0,0,,the fluorescent lamps are carried on to the packing department.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:13.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,这是一道需要灵巧与精密的工序
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.00,0:21:13.44,Original,,0,0,0,,It's a process which requires dexterity and precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:21.22,Translation,,0,0,0,,汞、荧光粉和喷灯打造出的这种装置，近一个世纪未曾改变
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.00,0:21:21.22,Original,,0,0,0,,Mercury, phosphorus, and blow torches fashion a device that hasn't changed in almost one hundred years.
